==Trivia==
*Kappy Kawano may have been inspired by [[wikipedia:Kuzenbo|Kuzenbo]], the king of the ''[[wikipedia:Kappa (folklore)|kappa]]'' in Japanese mythology.
*Kappy Kawano could be a reference to two different fictional fathers:
**One is [http://stat.ameba.jp/user_images/20160617/20/yoko5137/a2/f8/j/o0480084413675182605.jpg Mr. Yumeno], Sally's father from the first ever magical girl anime, [[wikipedia:Sally the Witch|''Sally the Witch'']]. The hairstyle and color match up, both have overbearing wives, and the surnames Yumeno and Kawano are both spelled with the kanji 野 in Japanese. Interestingly enough, Mr. Yumeno is also known as the Maō (魔王, "Demon King"), while his own father is referred to as the Daimaō (大魔王, "Great Demon King"), a title also held by the previous Great [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]], [[Infernal Tyrant Nyandam]], in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]].
**Another possibility is the ''Tekken'' character [[wikia:tekken:Heihachi Mishima|Heihachi Mishima]], who not only has a similar hairstyle to Kawano, but is also highly muscular, adept at fighting, and can wear a ''[[wikipedia:Fundoshi|fundoshi]]'' (traditional Japanese loincloth) in ''Tekken 7''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[wikia:tekken:Tekken 7 DLC|DLC]]. The extremely overbearing wife mentioned in Kawano's Japanese description could be referring to [[wikia:tekken:Devil Kazumi|Devil Kazumi]], a powerful alter-ego of Heihachi's wife [[wikia:tekken:Kazumi Mishima|Kazumi]] who tried to kill her husband.
*Kawano (川野) is a common Japanese surname spelled using the kanji for "river" (川) and "plains", "field", "rustic", or "civilian life" (野).
*Kappy Kawano was foreshadowed by the [[Media:Eve l 078 11 en.png|event poster]] for the 2023 [[Summer Break Cats]] event, which shows a cat using a cucumber as fishing bait.
*His English description has a typo: it says his bitter melon diet "makes him fearsome enemy" when it should say, "makes him ''a'' fearsome enemy".
*Speed and attack rate are the only things Kappy Kawano is weaker in than his [[Kappy Jr.|son]].
*He has the highest base attack power of any Traitless enemy.

